es  in this race  to avoid ecological disaster  the world could use  indian leadership  adani green energy is one of the top  players in this field the company's main  business is solar energy generation and  it has a portfolio of about 15 gigawatts  of renewable energy 15 percent of the  country's total renewable capacity  although green energy has seen a lot of  investors interest in the last year  and the stock price has shot up 600  times that has added almost 20 billion  dollar to his net worth  but the billionaire wants more  adani green energy aims to become the  world's largest renewable energy company  and adani said he will invest 20 billion  dollars into the sector over the next  decade  but his journey to domination might not  be easy as mukesh ambani joins  the world is entering a new energy era  which is going to be highly destructive  ambani is known for a big disrupter  wherever he is entered he has actually  broken cost barriers telecom is the  latest example six seven years ago uh  people thought that  his his telecom venture jio was a small  company but today it's probably the  largest telecom uh service provider in  the country  good evening freelance jio they have  stormed the market all the existing  players they have been bleeding under  the stiff price competition that  reliance jio has brought in  reliance's main  business strategy has been the scale the  huge scale they bring in to every  business they get into there's a scale  that kind of bulldozes the competition  similarly he is going to replicate the  same skill in renewable space as well  ambani says he will invest 10 billion  dollars in solar green hydrogen  batteries and fuel cells in the next  three years overlapping with adani's  plan  both billionaires are also focusing on  manufacturing and making solar panels  could be one area in which they compete  fiercely  [Music]  there are two factors basically in  bringing down the cost of renewable  energy you need  cheaper solar module